  "goodToKnow": "Die Homosexualität is the neutral, formal term. All nouns ending in -ität are feminine: die Universität, die Qualität. In Berlin, the Magnus-Hirschfeld-Gesellschaft keeps the memory of the Institut für Sexualwissenschaft, founded in 1919 and destroyed by the Nazis in 1933. Paragraph 175, which criminalised sex between men, was finally abolished in 1994. For everyday talk, people use schwul or lesbisch."
